# Entrywise operations on real matrices produce real coordinate values.
forall m, n N, A, B matrix(R,m,n), row closed_range(1,m), col closed_range(1,n):
    matrix_add(A,B,m,n)(row,col) $in R

forall m, n N, A, B matrix(R,m,n), row closed_range(1,m), col closed_range(1,n):
    matrix_sub(A,B,m,n)(row,col) $in R
